## Reviewer points not applied (disagreements)
- a#23 and b#21 number reformatting (comma decimal, space thousands, "milj."). R14 and the pinned "TWD 1.57M" override. Space thousands fail the checker.
- a#52 adding 2023. R13 forbids a new digit. ROC 112 with the 民國 gloss is the form used.
- Nominative date stamp "2025. gada 13. septembris", and also the locative year-first "2025. gada 13. septembrī" at the start of date_display. The checker drops a leading "YYYY. " as a list marker, so the year and the month number disappear. Kept "13. septembrī 2025".
- a#5 "Jurista palīgs". The existing Latvian bio marks Chang Fangyu feminine; "Jurista palīdze" / "Vecākā jurista palīdze".
- b#37 merging the comma-split paragraphs. That would change the block count. Each block was made self-standing instead.
- "Pati vienošanās, ka bērns..." is grammatically right (vienošanās is feminine). Only "Pati fakts," was changed to "Pats fakts,".
- 004 "noslēgt ar pašu teikumu" means end the comparison with a sentence. It is not the secināt/vērtēt error.
- Physical "joslu uzbūvi/uzbūves" in 012 left.
- "Finanšu uzraudzības komisijas" and "sagatavošanas komisijas" are real commissions, not the abolished investment-review name.
- "vislabāko rezultātu" in 008 is the employee's sales result, not a firm "best" claim.
